# Varesa Columbina Ineffa Xilonen. ~19s Rot. KQMS KurtC. Varesa Lunarcharge. 7 plunge Varesa. 1 E Xilonen. Columbina & Ineffa burst as available after the 1st rotation.

# Team
varesa char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
varesa add weapon="widsith" refine=3 lvl=90/90;
varesa add set="lno" count=4;
#varesa add set="notsu" count=4;
